{{!-- The named moments within the season, and what fires at each.

      The wheel turning is not the only thing that happens in a season. "When the autumn harvest is
      complete" fires DURING autumn, and the sheet has no way to know when: no amount of watching the
      calendar tells it the harvest came in or that anyone led the hunt. So this is an offer the table
      takes up, not a schedule the sheet runs — one panel per moment, each with its own statement and
      its own Apply, each owed again when its season next comes round.

      Only moments something built actually fires at are here. An empty panel headed "The autumn
      harvest" would read as a thing left undone.

      No heading of its own: it used to be a section called "This season", exiled BELOW the turn.
      It now sits inside "During <season>", which says that already — and each moment's own title
      says which moment it is.

      Params: turnover (TurnoverSnapshot), momentSteps (the season's own moment steps by key). --}}
<div class="steading-moments">

	{{#each turnover.moments}}
		<article class="steading-moment{{#if applied}} is-applied{{/if}}" data-moment="{{key}}">

			<h4 class="steading-moment-title">
				{{localize labelKey}}
				{{#if applied}}
					{{!-- Said rather than shown by absence: six people share this document, and the one
					      who was not here when it was pressed has no other way to learn it happened. --}}
					<span class="steading-moment-state">{{localize "stonetop.steading.effects.momentApplied"}}</span>
				{{/if}}
			</h4>

			{{!-- The SEASON's own half of the moment, where it has one. Autumn's move ends "when the
			      harvest is complete, roll 1d4; the steading generates that much Surplus" — the book's
			      own line, which belongs in the harvest's section beside the mill and the orchard
			      rather than only inside the move's text. Sourced to the season, not an improvement,
			      because nothing built causes it. --}}
			{{#with (lookup ../momentSteps key)}}
				{{#if noteKey}}
					<ul class="steading-statement-lines steading-statement-lines--sourced stonetop-unmarked">
						<li class="steading-statement-line">
							<span class="steading-statement-source">{{localize "stonetop.steading.seasons.theSeason"}}</span>
							<span class="steading-statement-clause">{{localize noteKey die=die}}</span>
						</li>
					</ul>
				{{/if}}
			{{/with}}

			{{> "stonetop.steading-statement" statement=statement showAdvisory=true
			    showAdjustments=true showSource=true showDelta=true
			    applyAllAction="applyMoment" applyAllSlug=key
			    applyAllLabel="stonetop.steading.effects.applyMoment"}}

		</article>
	{{/each}}

</div>
